[en.CHARACTER_ACACIA_PIE_NAME]
Acacia Pie

[en.CHARACTER_ACACIA_PIE_DESC]
Although she was a member of the Pie family, perhaps her blood ties with the Apple family were even closer. Acacia Pie was quiet and introverted, but she always possessed fantastic artistic creativity. She enjoyed doing household chores while simultaneously carving wood sculptures.

[zh.CHARACTER_ACACIA_PIE_NAME]
相思·派

[zh.CHARACTER_ACACIA_PIE_DESC]
虽然她是派家族的一员，但也许她与苹果家族的血缘关系要更近一些。相思·派安静又内向，但是总是拥有很棒的艺术创意，她喜欢一边做家务一边做木雕。
